# Level 3 — the route (docs/drahtseilakt/autopilot-rules.md): sectors, stretches in order, the ball, the action.
# From the walkthrough's storyboard (ref/video/frames/fast/level03); the plan and hints made from it are
# Level_03.plan and Level_03.txt.

sector 1 wood
  start → P_Trafo_Stone_01                                            pass into it → stone
  the rail east, P_Ball_Stone_01 rolled ahead on it                   pass
  down to the seesaw P_Modul_30_01, over it west from a run-up        press → P_Trafo_Wood_01 → wood
  back east over the seesaw and the hanging plates P_Modul_29_01      pass (wood: the plates hold it)
  P_Extra_Life_01 → P_Trafo_Stone_02 → P_Trafo_Wood_02                pass into each
  → P_Trafo_Paper_01                                                  pass into it → paper
  down the lane east → PC_TwoFlames_01                                pass

sector 2 paper
  → P_Trafo_Stone_03                                                  pass into it → stone
  the long rails east down along z 75.13                              press at full speed: their end throws the
                                                                      ball back onto the rail south
  the steep rail south along x 557.96, P_Extra_Life_03                press at full speed: its foot throws the
                                                                      ball onto the ledge of rail grooves
  east along the groove z -132.72, round the U into z -140.31,        press, along; hold at its end
  west to its end
  the groove z -140.31 east, down to the platform → PC_TwoFlames_02   press at a push

sector 3 stone
  the long descent onto the platform with the boxes P_Box_01..08      pass
  south past them to the rails' U at the platform's south end         press, along the U
  the rail north along x 1112.2 beside the boxes, off onto the floor  press
  east along z -66.8 past the paper transformer                       pass
  round from the east into P_Trafo_Wood_03 (a gap lies before it)    pass into it → wood
  south up the ramp beside the lane x 1178, round onto it, north      pass
  east along z -31: P_Ball_Wood_01 shoved off the end                 press
  down onto the floor, east → PC_TwoFlames_03                         pass

sector 4 wood
  → P_Trafo_Stone_05                                                  pass into it → stone
  north, east along z -80 into the end of the pole P_Modul_17_01      press: it swings onto the drawbridge
                                                                      P_Modul_25_05, which falls
  back, east over that bridge along z -101                            pass
  the corridor z -108.4 into the target of P_Modul_37_01              hold, press, push: its plank falls as the
                                                                      narrow way x 1409
  east into the end of the pole P_Modul_17_02 (1377.5 -116.5)         press: it knocks P_Modul_25_04 down
  back west, south round to the bridge P_Modul_25_04, east over it    press at a run
  north along the plank x 1409, east → PC_TwoFlames_04                press (off its line a stone ball falls)

sector 5 stone
  the rails east → P_Trafo_Paper_04                                   press into it → paper
  the updrafts P_Modul_18_02/03, P_Extra_Life_04, P_Modul_18_04        wait over each grate → lifted, on
  → P_Trafo_Wood_05                                                   pass into it → wood
  the track east, up the slope → PE_Balloon_01                        pass
